        "Letting leads go cold between touches instead of maintaining a structured follow-up cadence.",
        "Failing to note what the prospect said mattered most on the first call, then repeating generic talking points on later calls.",
        "Ignoring the possibility that Original Medicare plus a Supplement might genuinely suit the prospect better than an Advantage plan.",
        "Not tracking which specific objections keep surfacing across a book of comparison-stage leads, missing a chance to refine the pitch.",
