    title: "Michigan Debt Relief Leads: A Guide for Companies",
    metaTitle: "Michigan Debt Relief Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "A guide to sourcing debt relief leads specifically within the Michigan market.",
    metaDescription: "Michigan's debt relief market has its own regulatory requirements — this guide covers how companies source and convert leads specific to the state.",
